ClauseShiftKenyahttps://clauseshift.comclauseshift.comhttps://www.linkedin.com/company/clauseshift2026Artificial Intelligence (AI), Legal, Legal Tech, SaaSNairobiNairobi, Nairobi Area, KenyaAI contract review that quotes the exact clause behind every risk it flags. Risk score, key dates, dual-model cross-check. Free to start.ClauseShift is an AI contract review tool that shows its receipts: every risk it flags quotes the exact clause it came from, so users verify the wording themselves instead of trusting a verdict. Paste or upload a lease, job offer, NDA, or client contract and get a 0 to 10 risk score, plain-English findings, key dates with deadline reminders, an ask-the-contract Q&A, and a dual-model AI cross-check that reconciles two models to cut hallucinations. Documents are never kept after analysis and never used to train AI. ClauseShift is free to start on the web at clauseshift.com, with apps on Android (Amazon Appstore, Google Play testing) and Windows (Microsoft Store). Built by Monsiu Tech Solutions in Nairobi, Kenya. ClauseShift provides informational risk summaries, not legal advice.1-10ke
