AXI MOBILITYKenyahttps://aximobility.com/aximobility.comhttps://linkedin.com/company/aximobility2025Artificial Intelligence (AI), Fleet Management, Internet of Things, Logistics, SaaSNairobiNairobi, Nairobi Area, KenyaAI-powered fleet management platform helping African and LATAM operators cut fuel costs, track vehicles, and run smarter operations.AXI MOBILITY helps commercial fleet operators in Africa and LATAM cut fuel costs and run more efficient operations. Fleet managers running 5 to 500 vehicles face a common problem: fuel theft, poor driver behavior, and expired documents drain money and create compliance risk, with limited visibility into what's actually happening on the road. AXI starts by giving them that visibility - live vehicle tracking, fuel monitoring that flags anomalies as they happen, driver safety scoring, and automated document compliance - all in one platform with an AI assistant that answers fleet questions from real data. The broader platform extends into total cost of ownership management and fleet transition planning, helping operators make smarter long-term decisions about their vehicles and operations. Based in Nairobi, Kenya. Supported by Nvidia Inception, 500 Global, and Timbuktoo Africa.1-10ke
